# Training program source files dropped at repo root (xlsx + handwritten
# PDFs). They feed the import scripts under scripts/import-*.cjs and
# stay local-only — the imported state lives in Supabase. Anchored to
# the root with a leading slash so _branding/*.pdf and other tracked
# subdir binaries are unaffected.
/*.xlsx
/*.pdf

# One-shot investigation outputs from data-quality work (SuperSet rot,
# data audits, etc.). Re-runnable from the source script — committing
# them just rots fast.
scripts/audit-*.json
scripts/verify-*.json
scripts/fix-*.dryrun.json
tmp-drive-xlsx/
